{#
calendar/_happening_soon.html.twig
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
"Happening Soon": everything expected within the fortnight — what plMail read
out of mail and what the owner put in the calendar themselves — loaded into the
app's body-level modal frame.

Accepts:
  rows             list<HappeningSoonRow> — already windowed, ordered, COLLAPSED
                   and capped by HappeningSoonReader; this template windows
                   nothing, sorts nothing and merges nothing
  insights         list<MailInsight> — the radar's dated cards, windowed and
                   ordered by MailInsightRepository::upcomingForUser()
  undatedInsights  list<MailInsight> — the undated family (GitHub activity),
                   from recentUndatedForUser()

One meeting is one row. A meeting that reached plMail twice — extracted from its
invitation onto the account's calendar, mirrored from the provider onto a Remote
one — is one HappeningSoonRow carrying both, exactly as the grid draws it as one
chip. Where it is more than one row of the database, the icon tile wears the
same conic-gradient dot _event_chip wears and names the calendars in its title,
because a list that silently merges is indistinguishable from a list that lost
something.

Four things per row, and each earns its place. The ICON, off the row rather than
straight off the enum, so a fortnight can be read by shape before it is read by
word — a plane among boxes is found without reading anything, and an event
nobody extracted gets a plain calendar mark rather than a hole in the column.
WHEN, because that is the question. WHAT. And WHICH MESSAGE it came from, where
there is one: an extracted row is a guess a program made about somebody's mail,
and "why is this on my calendar?" has to be answerable in one click or the guess
is unfalsifiable. That link is the whole reason extracted events are marked as
extracted, and its absence on a hand-made row is the correct answer — nothing
made that one but the person reading it.

Below the calendar list sits THE RADAR: the mail insights (MailInsight) whose
whole point is that they are NOT calendar events — a parcel has an ETA days
wide, a pull request has no date at all, and forcing either into an occurrence
row would put fake times on real things (see InsightKind's doc). They share
this panel rather than growing one of their own for the reason the controller
records about pages: both answer "what is coming up?" and nobody would open two
dialogs to ask it once. Cards rather than lines, because an insight carries
verbs — track the parcel, open the mail, wave it away — and a line has nowhere
to put them. An empty radar renders NOTHING, not an empty state: the calendar
list above is the panel's answer, and a second "nothing here" under a real list
would read as a fault.

The provenance link carries `data-turbo-frame="_top"`. Without it Turbo reads a
link inside a <turbo-frame> as a navigation OF that frame, so clicking "from
this email" would load the whole mailbox page into the dialog and leave the user
inside a modal with no way back to their mail. The event editor's form documents
the same trap from the other direction. The radar's "open the mail" link carries
it for the same reason.

A row whose message is gone renders without the link rather than with a dead
one. An event keeps its kind after the mail behind it is expunged
provider-side, and a link to a message that is not there is worse than no link.
The radar handles a thread gone the same way — MailInsight::$thread is SET NULL
on delete, and the card simply loses its mail link.

The empty state is written as an answer, not as an absence. "Nothing coming up"
plus a line saying what would appear here — a panel that opens on blank space
reads as a panel that failed to load, and this one is empty for most people on
most days, which is the normal case and must not look like a fault. It shows
only when EVERYTHING is empty: an empty calendar over a live radar is not an
empty panel.
#}

{% set rows = rows|default([]) %}
{% set insights = insights|default([]) %}
{% set undatedInsights = undatedInsights|default([]) %}

<turbo-frame id="modal" class="flex-1 min-h-0 flex flex-col">

    {% if rows is empty and insights is empty and undatedInsights is empty %}
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 pb-8 pt-4 text-center">
            <i class="fa-regular fa-calendar-check text-2xl text-ink-faint" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <p class="text-sm text-ink">{{ 'calendar.soon.empty'|trans }}</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-ink-faint max-w-xs">{{ 'calendar.soon.empty_hint'|trans }}</p>
        </div>
    {% else %}
        {# One scroller for list and radar together — two nested scroll regions
           in a modal is the "why won't this move" bug in waiting. #}
        <div class="flex-1 min-h-0 overflow-y-auto px-6 pb-5">

            {% if rows is not empty %}
                <ul class="divide-y divide-line">
                    {% for row in rows %}
                        {# Both fall back rather than rendering empty: a booking mail
                           with no Subject: header is rare and a blank line where the
                           provenance should be reads as a bug. #}
                        {% set row_title = row.event.title ?: 'calendar.soon.untitled'|trans %}
                        {% set row_from = 'calendar.soon.from'|trans({
                            '%subject%': row.source ? (row.source.subject ?: 'calendar.soon.untitled'|trans) : '',
                        }) %}

                        {# Equal slices in the members' order, the same construction and
                           the same reading as the merged chip's dot — one affordance
                           learned once. Built only for a merged row: a cluster of one
                           has a single calendar and a plain coloured dot would add a
                           mark to every line for no information. #}
                        {% if row.cluster.isMerged %}
                            {% set slices = [] %}
                            {% for color in row.cluster.colors %}
                                {% set slices = slices|merge([
                                    color
                                        ~ ' ' ~ (loop.index0 * 100 / row.cluster.colors|length)|round(3) ~ '%'
                                        ~ ' ' ~ (loop.index * 100 / row.cluster.colors|length)|round(3) ~ '%',
                                ]) %}
                            {% endfor %}
                            {% set row_on = 'calendar.chip.on_calendars'|trans({
                                '%calendars%': row.cluster.calendarNames|join(', '),
                            }) %}
                        {% endif %}

                        <li class="flex items-start gap-3 py-3">

                            {# The icon carries the kind's name as text for anyone who
                               cannot see it, so the row still says "Flight" rather than
                               leaving the shape to do all the work. #}
                            <span class="relative mt-0.5 flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center
                                         rounded-lg bg-sunken text-ink-muted">
                                <i class="{{ row.icon }} text-sm" aria-hidden="true"></i>

                                {% if row.cluster.isMerged %}
                                    <span class="absolute -right-0.5 -top-0.5 h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full
                                                 ring-2 ring-surface"
                                          style="background: conic-gradient({{ slices|join(', ') }})"
                                          title="{{ row_on }}"></span>
                                    <span class="sr-only">{{ row_on }}</span>
                                {% endif %}
                            </span>

                            <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
                                <p class="truncate text-sm font-medium text-ink" title="{{ row_title }}">
                                    {{ row_title }}
                                </p>

                                <p class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-ink-muted">
                                    <span class="sr-only">{{ row.transKey|trans }} · </span>
                                    {# An all-day row is floating — a wall date at
                                       midnight with no zone — so `false` keeps it in
                                       its own, and the reader's clock does not move it
                                       onto the day before. #}
                                    {{ row.startsAt|intl_date('EEEdMMM', row.event.isAllDay ? false : null) }}
                                    {%- if not row.event.isAllDay %} · {{ row.startsAt|date(clock.time) }}{% endif %}
                                </p>

                                {% if row.source is not null %}
                                    <a href="{{ path('app_mail_message', { id: row.source.id }) }}"
                                       data-turbo-frame="_top"
                                       class="mt-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center gap-1.5
                                              text-xs text-ink-faint hover:text-accent hover:underline"
                                       title="{{ row_from }}">
                                        <i class="fa-regular fa-envelope text-[10px] shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                        <span class="truncate">{{ row_from }}</span>
                                    </a>
                                {% endif %}
                            </div>
                        </li>
                    {% endfor %}
                </ul>
            {% endif %}

            {# ── The radar ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
               One Stimulus scope over both sections, so the per-action
               dismiss token is minted once rather than once per card. #}
            {% if insights is not empty or undatedInsights is not empty %}
                <div data-controller="insight--radar"
                     data-insight--radar-token-value="{{ csrf_token('insight-dismiss') }}"
                     class="{{ rows is not empty ? 'mt-3 border-t border-line pt-4' : 'pt-1' }}">

                    {% if insights is not empty %}
                        <section data-insight-section>
                            <h3 class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-ink-faint">
                                {{ 'insights.panel.heading'|trans }}
                            </h3>

                            <ul class="mt-2 space-y-2" data-insight-list>
                                {% for insight in insights %}
                                    {% set trackingUrl = insight.payload.trackingUrl|default(null) %}
                                    {% set status = insight.payload.status|default(null) %}
                                    {# Only the vocabulary the catalogue knows. An
                                       extractor's stray status must not print a raw
                                       translation key onto a card. #}
                                    {% set statusTone = {
                                        'announced':        'border-ink-faint/40 text-ink-muted',
                                        'in_transit':       'border-sky-500/40 text-sky-700 dark:text-sky-300',
                                        'out_for_delivery': 'border-amber-500/40 text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-300',
                                        'delivered':        'border-green-500/40 text-green-700 dark:text-green-300',
                                    }[status] ?? null %}

                                    <li data-insight-card
                                        data-insight-id="{{ insight.id }}"
                                        data-insight-kind="{{ insight.kind.value }}"
                                        class="rounded-pane border border-line bg-surface p-3 shadow-sm">
                                        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                                            {% include 'insight/_kind_chip.html.twig' with { kind: insight.kind } only %}

                                            <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
                                                <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2">
                                                    <p class="truncate text-sm font-semibold text-ink" title="{{ insight.title }}">
                                                        {{ insight.title }}
                                                    </p>
                                                    <button type="button"
                                                            data-action="click->insight--radar#dismiss"
                                                            data-insight--radar-url-param="{{ path('app_insight_dismiss', { id: insight.id }) }}"
                                                            aria-label="{{ 'insights.panel.dismiss'|trans }}"
                                                            title="{{ 'insights.panel.dismiss'|trans }}"
                                                            class="-mr-1.5 -mt-1 flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full
                                                                   text-ink-faint hover:bg-hover hover:text-ink transition-colors">
                                                        <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark text-xs" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                                    </button>
                                                </div>

                                                <p class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-ink-faint">
                                                    {{ insight.happensAt|intl_date('EEEdMMM') }}
                                                    {#- A parcel's ETA is a day, not an hour — its
                                                        midnight is a placeholder, not a time. -#}
                                                    {%- if insight.happensAt|date('His') != '000000' %} · {{ insight.happensAt|date(clock.time) }}{% endif %}
                                                    {% if statusTone is not null %}
                                                        <span data-insight-status="{{ status }}"
                                                              class="ml-1 inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2 py-px
                                                                     text-[11px] leading-[1.35] font-medium {{ statusTone }}">
                                                            {{ ('insights.status.' ~ status)|trans }}
                                                        </span>
                                                    {% endif %}
                                                </p>

                                                {% if trackingUrl is not empty or insight.thread is not null %}
                                                    <div class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5">
                                                        {% if trackingUrl is not empty %}
                                                            <a href="{{ trackingUrl }}"
                                                               target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
                                                               data-insight-track
                                                               class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent px-2.5 py-1
                                                                      text-xs font-medium text-accent-ink hover:bg-accent-strong transition-colors">
                                                                <i class="fa-solid fa-location-arrow text-[10px]" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                                                {{ 'insights.panel.track'|trans }}
                                                            </a>
                                                        {% endif %}
                                                        {% if insight.thread is not null %}
                                                            <a href="{{ path('app_mail_thread', { id: insight.thread.id }) }}"
                                                               data-turbo-frame="_top"
                                                               data-insight-open-mail
                                                               class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-line px-2.5 py-1
                                                                      text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted hover:bg-hover hover:text-ink transition-colors">
                                                                <i class="fa-regular fa-envelope text-[10px]" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                                                {{ 'insights.panel.open_mail'|trans }}
                                                            </a>
                                                        {% endif %}
                                                    </div>
                                                {% endif %}
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </li>
                                {% endfor %}
                            </ul>
                        </section>
                    {% endif %}

                    {% if undatedInsights is not empty %}
                        <section data-insight-section class="{{ insights is not empty ? 'mt-4' : '' }}">
                            <h3 class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-ink-faint">
                                {{ 'insights.panel.undated_heading'|trans }}
                            </h3>

                            <ul class="mt-2 space-y-2" data-insight-list>
                                {% for insight in undatedInsights %}
                                    {% set repo = insight.payload.repo|default(null) %}
                                    {% set number = insight.payload.number|default(null) %}
                                    {% set action = insight.payload.action|default(null) %}
                                    {% set url = insight.payload.url|default(null) %}

                                    <li data-insight-card
                                        data-insight-id="{{ insight.id }}"
                                        data-insight-kind="{{ insight.kind.value }}"
                                        class="rounded-pane border border-line bg-surface p-3 shadow-sm">
                                        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                                            {% include 'insight/_kind_chip.html.twig' with { kind: insight.kind } only %}

                                            <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
                                                <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2">
                                                    <p class="truncate text-sm font-semibold text-ink" title="{{ insight.title }}">
                                                        {{ insight.title }}
                                                    </p>
                                                    <button type="button"
                                                            data-action="click->insight--radar#dismiss"
                                                            data-insight--radar-url-param="{{ path('app_insight_dismiss', { id: insight.id }) }}"
                                                            aria-label="{{ 'insights.panel.dismiss'|trans }}"
                                                            title="{{ 'insights.panel.dismiss'|trans }}"
                                                            class="-mr-1.5 -mt-1 flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full
                                                                   text-ink-faint hover:bg-hover hover:text-ink transition-colors">
                                                        <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark text-xs" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                                    </button>
                                                </div>

                                                {% if repo is not empty or number is not null or action is not empty %}
                                                    <p class="mt-0.5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-1.5 gap-y-1 text-xs text-ink-faint">
                                                        {% if repo is not empty %}<span class="truncate">{{ repo }}</span>{% endif %}
                                                        {% if number is not null %}<span class="shrink-0">#{{ number }}</span>{% endif %}
                                                        {% if action is not empty %}
                                                            <span data-insight-action="{{ action }}"
                                                                  class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-ink-faint/40 px-2 py-px
                                                                         text-[11px] leading-[1.35] font-medium text-ink-muted">
                                                                {{ action }}
                                                            </span>
                                                        {% endif %}
                                                    </p>
                                                {% endif %}

                                                {% if url is not empty %}
                                                    <div class="mt-2">
                                                        {# The brand's own name rather than a
                                                           catalogue key — "GitHub" is not a word
                                                           any locale translates. #}
                                                        <a href="{{ url }}"
                                                           target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
                                                           data-insight-open-url
                                                           class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-line px-2.5 py-1
                                                                  text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted hover:bg-hover hover:text-ink transition-colors">
                                                            <i class="fa-brands fa-github text-[11px]" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                                            GitHub
                                                            <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square text-[9px]" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                                        </a>
                                                    </div>
                                                {% endif %}
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </li>
                                {% endfor %}
                            </ul>
                        </section>
                    {% endif %}
                </div>
            {% endif %}

        </div>
    {% endif %}

</turbo-frame>
